# Applies to deploy/Dockerfile only - BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore
# in preference to the repository's own, so the upstream file stays untouched.
#
# The root pom is a reactor over every module, and Maven refuses to start if one
# of them is missing - so every pom has to be here even though only one module
# is built. What is not needed is the other modules' sources: their artifacts
# come from the mounted local repository, already built.
.git
**/target
**/src
!kyuubi-routing-gateway/src
docs
**/*.md
